/* 摆棋页专属：常驻选人面板 / 蜂窝棋盘 / 幽灵棋子 / 移除热区 / 设置弹窗小件 */
/* 常驻选人面板:立绘缩略层(cover 头部优先,与图鉴列表同参数);404/无 art 透出首字 */
.p6 .ph-art { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background-size: cover; background-position: center 12%; }
/* 标题/思路输入 */
.tin { width: 100%; font-size: 26rpx; color: var(--txt); line-height: 1.6; }
.tarea { min-height: 120rpx; }
.cnt-r { margin-left: auto; font-size: 20rpx; color: var(--faint); }
.board { margin-top: 8rpx; }
/* 棋盘几何(格宽/高/列距/奇行错位)全部由 sim.js onReady 实测行宽后以 px 内联下发——
   本环境 wxss 的 rpx/百分比/aspect-ratio 均被放大(三轮实测),wxss 只保留形状/配色。
   ⚠️ 棋盘格类名用 .mhex(勿改回 .hex):全局 .hex 是图鉴羁绊槽(app.wxss 80×80rpx),同名会串样式。
   ⚠️ 空格子的类名是 is-empty,不能叫 empty:全局 .empty 是空态块(54rpx/36rpx 内边距+虚线框),
      会把 50px 的格子撑到 108px 高、整盘变形(2026-10-29 实测定位) */
.hexrow { display: flex; }
.mhex {
  position: relative;
  flex: none;               /* 奇行缩进后半格 + 7 列会超宽,不锁住会被 flex 压窄,行与行格宽就不一致了 */
  clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0 75%, 0 25%);
  background: #C9C2B2;
}
.mhex .hin {
  position: absolute; top: 4rpx; left: 4rpx; right: 4rpx; bottom: 4rpx;
  clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 25%, 100% 75%, 50% 100%, 0 75%, 0 25%);
  background: #F7F4EC;
  display: grid; place-items: center;
  font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 22rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #B4AC99;
}
.mhex.is-empty .hin { color: #B4AC99; font-size: 19rpx; }
/* 棋子立绘层:铺满内层六边形(裁形靠父级 clip-path),头部优先裁剪,与选人面板缩略同参数 */
.h-art { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background-size: cover; background-position: center 12%; }
.mhex.drop { background: var(--gold); }
.ghost {
  position: fixed; z-index: 66; width: 116rpx; height: 116rpx; border-radius: 24rpx;
  border: 5rpx solid; display: none; place-items: center;
  font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 48rpx; font-weight: 700;
  box-shadow: 0 26rpx 56rpx -18rpx rgba(58, 50, 38, .5);
  pointer-events: none;
}
/* 幽灵棋子:出现即定形,不做缩放/位移动画——起拖时任何额外动效都会被读成"抖一下" */
.ghost.on { display: grid; }
/* 幽灵棋子也带立绘:内圆角略小于外框,盖住底色但露出描边 */
.ghost-art { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; border-radius: 18rpx; background-size: cover; background-position: center 12%; }
/* 移除热区:拖动时贴在棋盘卡正上方(位置由 startDrag 量矩形后以 px 内联下发,不再写死屏幕顶部)。
   默认上移隐藏,拖动才滑入;悬停变实线红底提示可松手 */
.rmzone {
  position: fixed; z-index: 65;
  /* 设计稿样式:整条圆角矩形 + 虚线红边 + 浅粉底;必须不透明——热区正好压在人口 chips 上,
     半透明会透出底下的字。高度按 chips 行对齐(80rpx),不再是大厚块 */
  height: 80rpx; box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 20rpx; border: 2rpx dashed #E88E86;
  background: #FDECE9; color: #D9483C;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em;
  box-shadow: 0 10rpx 24rpx -18rpx rgba(196, 69, 60, .45);
  /* 收起态必须同时隐藏:热区 top 是动态值,只靠 translateY 上移在棋盘靠下时会停在屏幕里 */
  opacity: 0; visibility: hidden;
  transform: translateY(-160rpx);
  transition: transform .24s cubic-bezier(.32, .86, .28, 1), opacity .18s ease, background .16s ease, border-color .16s ease;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.rmzone.on { transform: none; opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }
/* 悬停:实线 + 更深一点的粉,给出"松手就会删"的确认感 */
.rmzone.hot { background: #FBDDD8; border-style: solid; border-color: #D9483C; }
.rm-ico { font-size: 22rpx; }
/* 操作回执条:移除/换位后底部浮出,3 秒内点一下撤销(设计稿「已移除 · 撤销」) */
.snack {
  position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 120rpx); z-index: 70;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10rpx;
  padding: 18rpx 30rpx; border-radius: 99rpx;
  background: rgba(58, 50, 38, .94); color: #FFF9EE; font-size: 25rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 16rpx 36rpx -16rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, .55);
  opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, 20rpx); pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
}
.snack.on { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); pointer-events: auto; }
.snack-ico { color: #E7C27A; font-weight: 700; }
.snack-act { color: #E7C27A; font-weight: 700; margin-left: 8rpx; }
.hstars { position: absolute; top: 7rpx; left: 0; right: 0; text-align: center; font-size: 14rpx; color: #E7A93C; letter-spacing: -2rpx; }
.hcmark { position: absolute; top: 14rpx; left: 14rpx; width: 28rpx; height: 28rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: #E0862F; color: #FFF6EC; font-size: 17rpx; font-weight: 800; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.hitems { position: absolute; bottom: 10rpx; left: 0; right: 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 4rpx; }
.hit { width: 21rpx; height: 21rpx; border-radius: 5rpx; background: rgba(38, 34, 28, .72); color: #F5F1E6; font-size: 14rpx; font-family: var(--serif); display: grid; place-items: center; }

/* 选人滚动区外包一层,用来在底部压一条渐变遮罩:首屏高度是按"面板+棋盘铺满一屏"算的,
   面板底往往停在半行上,直接截断像渲染坏了,渐隐一下既柔和又提示还能滑 */
.pickbox { position: relative; }
.pickfade { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 28rpx; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(251, 249, 243, 0), var(--card)); }
/* 空格子底部选棋弹窗:网格在固定高度里滚,弹层不顶满整屏(标题/数量徽标复用全局 .sheet/.pcount) */
.sheet-scroll { margin-top: 18rpx; }
/* 装备弹层是从棋子设置弹窗里点出来的,必须压在弹窗之上:
   全局 .scrim/.sheet 是 70/71,而 .modal-mask 是 80,不抬层级弹层会被弹窗整个盖住 */
.eq-scrim { z-index: 90; }
.eq-sheet { z-index: 91; }
.pick6 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 16rpx 9rpx; }
.p6 { text-align: center; }
/* 棋子头像是方块:宽度 86% 居中留边,高度用 padding-bottom 撑成等比正方形(比整列铺满小一点) */
.p6 .ph {
  position: relative; width: 86%; height: 0; margin: 0 auto; padding-bottom: 86%; border-radius: 12rpx;
  border: 4rpx solid; display: grid; place-items: center;
  font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 26rpx; font-weight: 700; box-sizing: border-box;
}
.p6 .ph .inner { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.p6 .ph .cb { position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; padding: 1rpx 8rpx; background: rgba(38, 34, 28, .75); color: #F5F1E6; font-size: 18rpx; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 0 10rpx 0 10rpx; font-family: initial; }
/* 已上阵角标:头像底部一条绿带,和绿框配合,比光看边框直观(面板与底部弹窗共用这套 .ph) */
.p6 .ph .ob {
  position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
  height: 24rpx; line-height: 24rpx; text-align: center;
  background: rgba(45, 164, 78, .92); color: #FFF9EE;
  font-size: 15rpx; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em;
  border-radius: 0 0 8rpx 8rpx; font-family: initial;
}
.p6 .ph.onboard { border-color: #2DA44E !important; }
.p6 .pn { display: block; font-size: 20rpx; color: var(--dim); margin-top: 7rpx; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
.circ { width: 70rpx; height: 70rpx; border-radius: 50%; background: #ECE6D8; color: var(--dim); font-size: 36rpx; display: grid; place-items: center; }
.circ.plus { background: var(--gold); color: #FFF9EE; }
.eqslot { position: relative; width: 106rpx; height: 106rpx; border-radius: 22rpx; border: 3rpx dashed var(--line-hi); display: grid; place-items: center; color: #B4AC99; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 32rpx; }
.eqslot.filled { border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(169, 134, 67, .5); background: var(--gold-dim); color: var(--gold-hi); font-size: 38rpx; }
/* 装备图标:填满槽位/装备格,圆角继承容器(外层有 border,inset 0 落在 padding box 上) */
.eq-ico { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; border-radius: inherit; background-size: cover; background-position: center; }
.eq-ch { font-size: 38rpx; color: var(--gold-hi); }
.eq-plus { font-size: 34rpx; color: #B4AC99; }
/* 已装槽位右上角的 ×:点它直接卸下(不再弹选择层) */
.eq-x {
  position: absolute; top: -12rpx; right: -12rpx; z-index: 2;
  width: 34rpx; height: 34rpx; border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(58, 50, 38, .92); color: #FFF6EC;
  font-size: 19rpx; line-height: 34rpx; text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0 3rpx 8rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, .28);
}
/* 装备弹层顶部三槽:点哪个槽,下一次选择就装到哪个槽;三槽整体居中 */
.eq-slots { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 22rpx; margin: 12rpx 0 2rpx; }
.eq-mini {
  position: relative; width: 96rpx; height: 96rpx; border-radius: 20rpx;
  border: 2rpx dashed var(--line-hi); background: var(--card);
  display: grid; place-items: center;
}
.eq-mini.filled { border-style: solid; border-color: rgba(169, 134, 67, .5); background: var(--gold-dim); }
.eq-mini.on { border-color: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3rpx rgba(169, 134, 67, .25); }
.eq-mini-ico { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; border-radius: inherit; background-size: cover; background-position: center; }
.eq-mini-plus { color: #B4AC99; font-size: 30rpx; }
.eq-mini-k { position: absolute; left: 8rpx; bottom: 4rpx; font-size: 16rpx; color: var(--faint); }
.h3-slot { margin-left: 12rpx; font-size: 22rpx; color: var(--gold-hi); font-family: initial; }
/* 棋盘格子上的小装备图标 */
.hit { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.hit-ico { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; border-radius: 5rpx; background-size: cover; background-position: center; }
/* 重置降权 + 保存吸底(A1/C4) */
.op-dim { color: var(--faint) !important; }
/* 宽度 100%:换 view 后不再受微信 button 内置 184px 宽度影响(2026-10-29 全站 button→view)。
   不再吸底:吸底会悬浮在棋盘上、压住最后一行格子,与"首屏正好铺满面板+棋盘"冲突;
   保存按钮随内容放在页尾(与设计稿一致),滚到底即可点 */
/* 底部双 CTA:保存与发布并排等宽、同款样式 */
.save-row { display: flex; gap: 16rpx; margin-top: 28rpx; }
.savebtn { flex: 1; height: 90rpx; line-height: 90rpx; text-align: center; border-radius: 26rpx; background: var(--gold); color: #FFF9EE; font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 700; box-shadow: 0 8rpx 24rpx -8rpx rgba(143,111,47,.5); }
/* 阵容羁绊图标:改用真实羁绊图(/art/icon,图标自带六边形底),
   去掉原来那个方块底+描边,只保留右下角计数角标;无图时仍回退首字 */
.trait .ic.img { background: none; border-color: transparent; width: 50rpx; height: 50rpx; }
.trait.color .ic.img { background: none; }
.trait .ic-ico { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background-size: contain; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; }
